         ->  Parallel Index Scan using pidx1_a_idx on orca_parallel.pidx1
               Output: pidx1.a, pidx1.b
               Index Cond: (pidx1.a IS NOT NULL)
         ->  Parallel Hash
               Output: (1), pidx2.c
               ->  Parallel Seq Scan on orca_parallel.pidx2
